[
  {"id":"family-daily-1-1","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族の中で、朝いちばんに話したくなる話題は？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-2","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家の中で一番落ち着く場所はどこ？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-3","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族で食べるなら、今何を食べたい？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-4","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族の口ぐせで思い浮かぶものは？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-5","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"休日の家族時間は、外出派？家で過ごす派？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-6","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族と一緒に見るなら、映画とドラマどっちがいい？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-7","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族の中で一番早起きなのは誰？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-8","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族からもらって嬉しかったものは？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-9","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家にあると安心するものは？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-10","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族で旅行するなら、海と山どっちに行きたい？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-11","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"最近、家族にありがとうと思ったことは？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-12","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族の中で、自分と性格が似ている人はいる？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-13","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族と一緒に挑戦してみたいことは？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-14","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族の写真を撮るなら、どんな瞬間を残したい？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-15","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族の話で、つい笑ってしまう思い出は？","category":"familyMemories","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-16","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家で続いている小さな習慣はある？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-17","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族におすすめしたい本や作品は？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-18","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族と季節を感じるのは、どんな時？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-19","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族と静かに過ごす時間は好き？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-20","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族から言われると嬉しい言葉は？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-21","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族の定番のおかずといえば何？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-22","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家の中で一番にぎやかな時間帯はいつ？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-23","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族と観たい映画や番組はある？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-24","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族の得意なこと、思いつくものは？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-25","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"今度の休日、家族と何をして過ごしたい？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-26","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族の好きな飲み物、思い浮かぶものは？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-27","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族と散歩するなら、どこまで歩きたい？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-28","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族の意外な一面を見たことはある？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-29","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家では誰がごはんを作ることが多い？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-30","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族と話すなら、リビングとダイニングどっち？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-31","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族で遊びに行くなら、動物園と水族館どっち？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-32","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族の写真、最近ちゃんと撮った？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-33","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族と一緒に掃除するなら、どこを担当したい？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-34","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族の寝る時間は、早い方？遅い方？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-35","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族が知らない自分の小さな特技はある？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-memories-1-36","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"子どもの頃、家族で行った場所でもう一度行きたいところは？","category":"familyMemories","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-memories-1-37","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族の昔の写真で、印象に残っているものは？","category":"familyMemories","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-memories-1-38","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族と過ごした誕生日で、覚えているものはある？","category":"familyMemories","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-memories-1-39","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"小さい頃に家族から言われて、今も覚えている言葉は？","category":"familyMemories","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-memories-1-40","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族と初めて出かけた先を、覚えている？","category":"familyMemories","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-memories-1-41","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族旅行で一番楽しかった場所はどこ？","category":"familyMemories","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-memories-1-42","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族とよく見ていたテレビ番組はあった？","category":"familyMemories","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-memories-1-43","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族の昔のあだ名で、今も使っているものはある？","category":"familyMemories","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-memories-1-44","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族と過ごした夏休みの思い出は？","category":"familyMemories","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-memories-1-45","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族が集まる時によく出てくる、昔の話はある？","category":"familyMemories","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-memories-1-46","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族と一緒につくった工作や作品を覚えている？","category":"familyMemories","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-memories-1-47","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族に初めて褒められた時のことを覚えている？","category":"familyMemories","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-memories-1-48","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族と過ごした年末年始の思い出はある？","category":"familyMemories","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-memories-1-49","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族の「昔はよくあそこへ行ったね」という話はある？","category":"familyMemories","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-memories-1-50","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族と撮った写真の中で、また見返したくなる一枚はある？","category":"familyMemories","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-2-1","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族とは毎日連絡を取りたい？必要な時だけでいい？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-2-2","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族と意見が違った時、すぐ話し合いたい？少し時間を置きたい？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-2-3","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族に謝るのは得意？苦手？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-2-4","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"困った時、家族に相談する方？一人で考える方？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-2-5","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族で決めることと、自分で決めたいことの違いは？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-care-2-6","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族に助けてほしい時、どんな頼み方なら言いやすい？","category":"familyCare","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-values-2-7","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族のいいところを一つ挙げるなら？","category":"familyValues","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-2-8","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族に直してほしいと思うことはある？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-boundaries-2-9","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族にも知られたくないことはある？","category":"familyBoundaries","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-care-2-10","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族に応援してほしいことはある？","category":"familyCare","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-boundaries-2-11","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族との距離が近すぎると感じる時はある？","category":"familyBoundaries","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-2-12","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"失敗したことを家族に話せる？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-values-2-13","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族の中で考え方が一番違うと感じることは？","category":"familyValues","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-values-2-14","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族でお金の話をするのは大事だと思う？","category":"familyValues","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-2-15","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族と過ごす時間は、長さと密度のどちらが大事？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-values-2-16","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族に期待しすぎているかもしれないと思うことは？","category":"familyValues","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-values-2-17","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族の中で自分が担っている役割は何だと思う？","category":"familyValues","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-care-2-18","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族が元気がない時、そっとしておく？声をかける？","category":"familyCare","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-2-19","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族に言いにくいけれど、伝えた方がいいと思うことはある？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-values-2-20","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族について、自分が思い込んでいたことはある？","category":"familyValues","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-2-21","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族と連絡を取るなら、電話とメッセージどっちが多い？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-2-22","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族との会話で、聞き役に回ることが多い？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-2-23","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族に自分の予定を、どこまで共有している？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-2-24","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族と話し合う前に、一旦落ち着きたい時はある？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-2-25","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族に感謝を伝える機会は、足りていると思う？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-2-26","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族との言い合いの後、後悔することはある？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-values-2-27","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族から学んだことで、自分も大事にしていることは？","category":"familyValues","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-values-2-28","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族の真似してみたい習慣はある？","category":"familyValues","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-values-2-29","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族の中で、自分だけは譲れない価値観はある？","category":"familyValues","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-values-2-30","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族の考え方で、自分には合わないと感じるところはある？","category":"familyValues","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-values-2-31","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族にとっての豊かさとは、何だと思う？","category":"familyValues","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-values-2-32","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族のルールの中で、意味が分かりにくいものはある？","category":"familyValues","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-care-2-33","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族の疲れが顔に出ていると感じた時、何て声をかける？","category":"familyCare","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-care-2-34","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"最近、家族にしてあげたいことはある？","category":"familyCare","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-care-2-35","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"自分が元気がない時、家族にはどう接してほしい？","category":"familyCare","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-care-2-36","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族の健康で、少し心配なことはある？","category":"familyCare","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-care-2-37","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族にお礼を言われた時、自分はどんな顔をすると思う？","category":"familyCare","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-care-2-38","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"風邪をひいた時、家族にどうしてもらいたい？","category":"familyCare","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-boundaries-2-39","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族に見られたくない持ち物や場所はある？","category":"familyBoundaries","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-boundaries-2-40","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"自室や自分の物に家族が入る時、気にする？","category":"familyBoundaries","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-boundaries-2-41","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族からのアドバイスが、受け取りにくいと感じる時はある？","category":"familyBoundaries","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-boundaries-2-42","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族に干渉されたくないと感じる場面は、どんな時？","category":"familyBoundaries","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-boundaries-2-43","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族との約束ごとで、自分から守りたいものはある？","category":"familyBoundaries","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-boundaries-2-44","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族に割り込まれたくない、自分だけの時間はある？","category":"familyBoundaries","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-2-45","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族と過ごす平日の夜は、どんな感じが理想？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-2-46","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族と分け合って食べたい料理はある？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-2-47","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"今度の家族との予定で、楽しみにしていることはある？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-2-48","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族と買ってよかったものはある？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-2-49","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家の中で、家族と一番話す場所はどこ？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-2-50","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族との時間の中で、小さくても幸せを感じる瞬間はある？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-values-3-1","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族に自分の考えを分かってもらえない時、どうしたい？","category":"familyValues","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-values-3-2","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族だからこそ分かってほしいと思うことは？","category":"familyValues","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-values-3-3","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族と価値観が違っても、一緒にいられると思う？","category":"familyValues","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-care-3-4","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族のために我慢していることはある？","category":"familyCare","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-values-3-5","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族の期待に応えたい気持ちと、自分の気持ちはどちらを優先したい？","category":"familyValues","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-3-6","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族に本音を話すために必要なことは何だと思う？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-values-3-7","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族の関係をよくしているものは何だと思う？","category":"familyValues","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-future-3-8","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族と違う道を選ぶことに不安はある？","category":"familyFuture","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-values-3-9","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族にとっての幸せは、自分にとっての幸せと同じだと思う？","category":"familyValues","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-3-10","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族に変わってほしいと思うことを、伝えるべきだと思う？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-care-3-11","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"自分が家族を支える側になることを想像したことはある？","category":"familyCare","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-memories-3-12","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族の過去について、もっと知りたいことはある？","category":"familyMemories","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-3-13","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族に伝えられていない謝りたいことはある？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-care-3-14","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族が困っていたら、自分の予定をどこまで変えられる？","category":"familyCare","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-care-3-15","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族にとっての安心感は、言葉と行動のどちらで生まれると思う？","category":"familyCare","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-values-3-16","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族と意見が合わない時、理解することと納得することは別だと思う？","category":"familyValues","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-memories-3-17","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族から受け継いだと思うものはある？","category":"familyMemories","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-boundaries-3-18","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族との距離を自分で決めたいと思う時はある？","category":"familyBoundaries","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-3-19","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族に弱さを見せることは、頼ることだと思う？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-future-3-20","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"これから家族とどんな時間を増やしたい？","category":"familyFuture","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-values-3-21","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族の生き方で、自分が影響を受けたと思う部分はある？","category":"familyValues","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-values-3-22","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族と同じ選択をしなかった経験はある？","category":"familyValues","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-values-3-23","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族同士を比べられた経験は、自分にどう残っている？","category":"familyValues","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-values-3-24","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族の幸せと自分の幸せが違う方向だったら、どう考えたい？","category":"familyValues","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-values-3-25","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"「うちの家らしい」と感じる瞬間は、どんな時？","category":"familyValues","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-3-26","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族と深い話をするきっかけは、自然に生まれる方がいい？決めてつくる方がいい？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-3-27","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族との間に沈黙が続いた時、何を感じる？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-3-28","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族の本音を、知りたくないと感じたことはある？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-3-29","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"言い方を変えれば分かり合えたかもしれない、という経験はある？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-3-30","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族との会話で、一番避けている話題はある？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-care-3-31","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族を支えることと、自分を支えることは両立できていると思う？","category":"familyCare","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-care-3-32","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族のために手放しかけたものはある？","category":"familyCare","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-care-3-33","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族が自分に弱みを見せないのは、強がりだと思う時がある？","category":"familyCare","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-care-3-34","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族の世話をする立場になった時、一番不安なことは何だと思う？","category":"familyCare","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-care-3-35","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族への思いやりが、義務のように感じられる時はある？","category":"familyCare","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-future-3-36","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"数年後、家族との関係は今より近くなっていると思う？遠くなっていると思う？","category":"familyFuture","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-future-3-37","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"将来、家族と住む場所が離れても平気だと思う？","category":"familyFuture","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-future-3-38","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族のこれからの計画について、自分の意見を言える？","category":"familyFuture","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-future-3-39","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"自分の将来の選択が家族に与える影響を、考えたことはある？","category":"familyFuture","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-future-3-40","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族と一緒に始めたい新しい習慣はある？","category":"familyFuture","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-memories-3-41","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族の過去の選択について、聞いてみたいことはある？","category":"familyMemories","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-memories-3-42","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"自分が生まれる前の家族の話で、知りたいことはある？","category":"familyMemories","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-memories-3-43","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族との思い出について、今なら正直な気持ちを言える？","category":"familyMemories","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-memories-3-44","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族の古い写真を見直すと、当時の空気が伝わってくることはある？","category":"familyMemories","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-memories-3-45","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族から聞いた話で、自分の生き方の参考になっているものはある？","category":"familyMemories","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-boundaries-3-46","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族との境界線を引いた時、罪悪感を覚える？","category":"familyBoundaries","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-boundaries-3-47","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族の決まりに従う時、その理由を自分でも説明できる？","category":"familyBoundaries","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-boundaries-3-48","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族に自分の時間や空間を尊重してほしいと、はっきり伝えたことはある？","category":"familyBoundaries","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-boundaries-3-49","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族との距離感を、ほかの家庭と比べてしまうことはある？","category":"familyBoundaries","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-boundaries-3-50","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族だからこそ越えてはいけない一線はあると思う？","category":"familyBoundaries","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-boundaries-4-1","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族に傷つけられたと感じた時、どうすれば自分を守れる？","category":"familyBoundaries","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-boundaries-4-2","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族だから許さなければいけない、と思うことはある？","category":"familyBoundaries","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-4-3","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族に言えないまま抱えている気持ちはある？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-values-4-4","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族の期待を背負うことに疲れた時、誰に相談したい？","category":"familyValues","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-boundaries-4-5","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族と距離を置くことは、関係を大切にする方法にもなり得る？","category":"familyBoundaries","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-future-4-6","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族が自分の選択を認めてくれなかったら、どうする？","category":"familyFuture","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-4-7","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族に謝ってほしいことがあるなら、伝える？待つ？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-4-8","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族に謝りたいことがあるなら、今伝えられる？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-boundaries-4-9","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族を守るために黙ることと、正直に話すことはどちらが大切？","category":"familyBoundaries","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-future-4-10","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族の事情と自分の人生がぶつかったら、どこで線を引きたい？","category":"familyFuture","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-values-4-11","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族の中で決められた役割から離れたいと思ったことはある？","category":"familyValues","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-4-12","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族に理解されないままでも、自分の選択を進められる？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-care-4-13","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族に助けを求めることをためらうのは、なぜだと思う？","category":"familyCare","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-4-14","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族に本当は分かってほしいことを、一つだけ伝えるなら何？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-future-4-15","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族との関係を変えるために、自分からできることはある？","category":"familyFuture","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-values-4-16","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族のお金の問題を、自分の問題としてどこまで引き受ける？","category":"familyValues","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-memories-4-17","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族の過去を知ることで、今の関係の見え方が変わると思う？","category":"familyMemories","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-boundaries-4-18","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族にも越えてほしくない境界線はある？","category":"familyBoundaries","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-4-19","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族に言葉で伝えられていない感謝はある？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-future-4-20","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"これから家族とどんな関係をつくっていきたい？","category":"familyFuture","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-4-21","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族との間で交わされた言葉の中に、今も心に残る傷はある？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-4-22","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族に本当の自分を出せないのは、相手のせい？自分のせいだと思う？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-4-23","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族との関係にわだかまりがあると、それを認めるのは怖い？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-4-24","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族に伝えたい本当の気持ちが、言葉にできないままになっている理由は？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-4-25","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族との関係で「もう遅い」と諦めていることはある？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-boundaries-4-26","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族からの期待が重すぎると感じたら、関係を保ちながら距離を変えられる？","category":"familyBoundaries","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-boundaries-4-27","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族の人生に自分の人生を合わせる必要はない、と言い切れる？","category":"familyBoundaries","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-boundaries-4-28","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族との関わりを減らすとしたら、何を失うことになると思う？","category":"familyBoundaries","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-boundaries-4-29","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族にお金や暮らしを頼られていると感じた時、どこまで応えたい？","category":"familyBoundaries","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-boundaries-4-30","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族のために我慢し続けた結果、限界が来たことはある？","category":"familyBoundaries","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-values-4-31","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族が信じていることを、内心で疑ったまま過ごしたことはある？","category":"familyValues","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-values-4-32","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族の価値観とぶつかった時、自分を曲げるべきだと思う瞬間はある？","category":"familyValues","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-values-4-33","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族のために夢を諦めることを、正しいと感じられる？","category":"familyValues","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-values-4-34","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族の中で自分だけ置き去りにされたと感じたことはある？","category":"familyValues","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-values-4-35","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族の在り方を否定された時、自分自身を否定されたように感じる？","category":"familyValues","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-future-4-36","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"親世代の介護や看取りについて、具体的に考えたことはある？","category":"familyFuture","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-future-4-37","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族との縁を薄くする選択を、自分は許せると思う？","category":"familyFuture","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-future-4-38","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族の期待を裏切る道を選んだ先の孤独を、受け入れられる？","category":"familyFuture","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-future-4-39","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"自分が親になった時、家族から受け継ぎたくないことはある？","category":"familyFuture","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-future-4-40","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族との別れの時を考えると、今のうちに伝えておきたいことはある？","category":"familyFuture","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-care-4-41","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族の弱さを目にした時、支えたい気持ちと目をそらしたい気持ち、どちらが勝る？","category":"familyCare","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-care-4-42","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族を支えきれなくなった自分を、許せると思う？","category":"familyCare","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-care-4-43","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族のために限界を超えてきた結果、心が折れた経験はある？","category":"familyCare","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-care-4-44","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族に必要とされなくなった時、自分の居場所をどう考える？","category":"familyCare","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-care-4-45","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族の世話や介護への不安を、誰かに話せる？","category":"familyCare","source":"editorial"},
