  {"id":"family-memories-4-47","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族から受けた言葉による傷は、今も癒えていない？","category":"familyMemories","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-memories-4-48","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族の秘密を知ってしまった経験を、どう扱えばいいと思う？","category":"familyMemories","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-memories-4-49","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族の過去の失敗を、自分は繰り返さないと誓える？","category":"familyMemories","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-memories-4-50","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族との記憶の中で、まだ整理できていない感情はある？","category":"familyMemories","source":"editorial"}
